    "detailed_description": "<strong>Love Exalt 8372</strong> is a mystery visual novel inspired by games like <strong>Danganronpa,</strong> <strong>Your Turn to Die,</strong> and the <strong>Zero Escape</strong> series.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295280/extras/67e624a6e6f83a29c051be8b9cc31a17.avif?t=1752778199\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295280/extras/98d1c5981621875f1132d9580826b7b9.avif?t=1752778199\" /></span><br><br>In a world where monsters have been farmed to extinction for XP, <strong>twelve people</strong> with unique <strong>RPG class types</strong> board a train; among these twelve people, the <strong>last monster</strong> is hiding. Some passengers are oblivious victims... while others boarded this train with a plan <strong>already in motion.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295280/extras/1f8f85bf461c437c1bc5875fbabf5fa1.avif?t=1752778199\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295280/extras/58037ef2635883a991639aa3182cb3c6.avif?t=1752778199\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295280/extras/a889bd5b6c0415fd71807e17bf544dd5.poster.avif?t=1752778199\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295280/extras/a889bd5b6c0415fd71807e17bf544dd5.webm?t=1752778199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295280/extras/a889bd5b6c0415fd71807e17bf544dd5.mp4?t=1752778199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><